  "bodyHash": "32f6d667403dad56",
  "content": "<html>\n<head><title>Create Stuff 'N Additions</title></head>\n<body>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1156/586/create_stuff_title_final-png.png\" alt=\"Create Stuff 'N Additions Title\" width=\"1673\" height=\"592\">\n</div>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@FurtiTwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/985/youtube-png.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fsketchfab.com%252ffurti_two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1807/822/image_2026-07-20_221457219-png.png\" alt=\"Sketchfab\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffurtitwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/988/donate-png.png\" alt=\"Donate\" width=\"22%\" height=\"22%\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/furti_two/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/986/curseforge-png.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252ffurti-two\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1224/984/modrinth-png.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"19%\" height=\"19%\">\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">\n  Create Stuff 'N Additions 是一個使用 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 資源的模組，提供一套全新的裝備、工具和小道具！這些裝備可以提升你的體力（例如力量或挖掘速度），同時也能讓你以新的方式移動，比如漂浮、彈跳甚至飛行！根據你的裝備種類（黃銅、安山岩或銅），你需要不同的燃料來源——蒸汽（需用水和燃料）、熱能（僅使用燃料）或液壓能（僅用水）！此模組也新增大量配方，讓某些 Minecraft 物品（如鐵網盔甲、珊瑚、下獄岩、哭泣的鑽石和岩浆膏…）可以使用 Create 加入的新方法（如侵蝕和填充）來製作！\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>最初此模組是為法國伺服器 \"Mechanical Life\" 而製作的。</strong> 此模組使用 Hybrid Mcreator 製作。</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ueNNUy6enNE?si=wx5D5bbB-RDCxuIL\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LAP-V3GiwYM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pKb8vEXkRW8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe>\n</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>規劃中的功能&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n  <p>- 無人機手冊（安山岩無人機）</p>\n  <p>- 可程式化無人機（黃銅無人機）</p>\n  <p>- 創意模式車輛分類表</p>\n  <p>- 潛水艇</p>\n  <p>- 滑板車</p>\n  <p>- 設定檔案</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>你可以將 Create Stuff Additions 加入你的整合包中。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>舊描述（v2.0.0 之前）：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n  <p><strong>⛽要為你的物品供能，請將其放在副手欄（按住 F 即可），然後在主手放置燃料（煤炭、木材…並按下 Q 丟出）</strong></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n  <p><strong>新工具：</strong></p>\n  <p><br>噴嘴風扇（推送敵人以反彈箭矢）、烈焰噴火器（發射火焰）、便攜式黃銅鑽頭（採礦速度極快但無法附魔）以及抓手爪鉤（僅支援 1.18.2）</p>\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/632/image_2026-06-28_190551996-png.png\" alt=\"New Tools Image\" width=\"1357\" height=\"483\">\n  <p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pvgL6kiceII?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n  <p><br><strong>舊/新 Create 工具：</strong></p>\n  <p><br>銅工具、鋅工具和黃銅工具<br>\n    <strong>灼燒工具：</strong> 打破的石頭會變成平滑岩石（石頭→平滑岩石，花崗岩→輝長岩，原木→木炭等），並能點燃對擊的生物（需要使用混合器製作）<br>\n    <strong>鍍金石英工具：</strong> 比鑽石更有效率，攻擊力低但攻擊速度快（需要透過機械製作者製作）<br>\n    <strong>影鋼工具（1.18.2 中的經驗工具）：</strong> 同鐵的採礦等級但比黃金更快採礦速度。</p>\n  <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/633/image_2026-06-28_190603107-png.png\" alt=\"Tool Images\" width=\"1037\" height=\"362\"><br><br><br></p>\n  <p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>黃銅噴氣背包與黃銅外骨骼：</strong><br>\n    噴氣背包讓你飛行。黃銅外骨骼是一種能提供力量或敏捷效果的甲胄（需透過機械製作者製作）。它們使用燃料（於第二格放置燃料，後按 Q 丟棄，如同煤炭、烈焰棒或木材）。</p>\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/634/image_2026-06-28_190613334-png.png\" alt=\"Jetpack and Exoskeleton\" width=\"2334\" height=\"1700\"><br><br></p>\n  \n  <p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">銅、鋅、黃銅 armor 與黃銅滑板車：</span></strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/635/image_2026-06-28_190631737-png.png\" alt=\"Armor Set\" width=\"2040\" height=\"966\"></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n  <p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>其他內容：</strong></span><br>\n    <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1761/636/image_2026-06-28_190648706-png.png\" alt=\"Other Stuff\" width=\"1153\" height=\"336\"></p>\n  <p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\">你也可以查看我的其他模組：</p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\">\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/useless-sword\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/416/64/64/637746702745178325.png\" alt=\"Useless Sword\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/items-to-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1070/646/64/64/638606054091700999.png\" alt=\"Items to Mobs\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stalwart-dungeons\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/588/64/64/637853847063684188.png\" alt=\"Stalwart Dungeons\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/seeds\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/657/638184557398425576.png\" alt=\"Seeds\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/organics\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/413/64/64/637746699816017646.png\" alt=\"Organics\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/slimy-stuff\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1076/873/64/64/638614825744489631.png\" alt=\"Slimy Stuff\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nethers-exoticism\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/724/578/64/64/638077506455486007.png\" alt=\"Nether's Exoticism\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frosted-friends\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/465/411/64/64/637746696852738455.png\" alt=\"Frosted Friends\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wandering-bags\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/689/759/64/64/638069994452394564.png\" alt=\"Wandering Bags\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-torpedoes\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/674/64/64/638476410476119618.png\" alt=\"Alexs Caves Torpedoes\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/depth\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/811/720/638184653709126308.png\" alt=\"Depth\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/call-of-yucutan\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1002/886/64/64/638523299285638581.png\" alt=\"Call of Yucutan\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enders-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/779/326/64/64/638124003553252444.png\" alt=\"Ender's Delight\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sons-of-sins\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1052/109/sons_of_sins_logo_bis.png\" alt=\"Sons of Sins\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-confectionery\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/531/246/64/64/637852985411120756.png\" alt=\"Create Confectionery\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-stuff-additions\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/608/519/64/64/637987931627550518.png\" alt=\"Create Stuff Additions\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-logistics\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1116/69/64/64/638670333200272317.png\" alt=\"Create Logistics\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-weight\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/734/378/64/64/638084439152506136.png\" alt=\"Armor Weight\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamo\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/973/774/64/64/638476553282271633.png\" alt=\"Dynamo\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ninjaxxs-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/549/392/64/64/637886561525247638.png\" alt=\"Ninjaxxs Needs\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fuzes-relics\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/580/980/64/64/637945482784615684.png\" alt=\"Fuzes Relics\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chained-to-your-friends\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1387/269/256/256/638899446157903400.png\" alt=\"Chained To Your Friends\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jawas-lightsaber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n      <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1877/284/256/256/639176009777204482.png\" alt=\"Jawas Lightsaber\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n    </a>\n  </p>\n  <p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
